# {{title}} weekly status

Add one file per week named `YYYY-MM-DD.md` (the Friday of the week). Send the
same content to the client; keep client-identifying detail and money out of it.
Rules: [project operations](../../../business/engagement-operations.md#weekly-status-report).

## Report format

Copy everything below into the new file and fill it in.

```markdown
---
title: "{{title}} status YYYY-MM-DD"
type: project
status: proposed
owner: founder
last_reviewed: YYYY-MM-DD
---

# {{title}} status YYYY-MM-DD

**Overall:** on track | at risk | off track. One sentence why.
**Stage:** L6 Deliver, method stage NN. Next gate and its date.

## Done this week

- Item

## Next week

- Item

## Decisions needed from the client

| Decision | Options | Needed by | Consequence of delay |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |

## Risks and issues

Changes since last week; full log in ../risks.md.

## Scope and change requests

None, or the change-request reference and its state.
```
